{"seq":3,"slug":"telegraph-tells","title":"预告与可读性：公平感的全部秘密","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-boss-encounter-design/structure/telegraph-tells","wordCount":1451,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"预告与可读性-公平感的全部秘密\">预告与可读性：公平感的全部秘密</h1><p>同一个招式，前摇清晰它就是「难但公平」，前摇含糊它就是「耍赖」。玩家骂一个 Boss「不公平」，十有八九不是因为它伤害高，而是因为他「看不出它要干什么」。预告（telegraph）是 Boss 战里最被低估、却最决定口碑的一环——它把不可能完成的反应，变成可以学会的技能。本篇讲怎么让每一招都「读得出」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-预告是一次三通道的信息广播\">核心概念：预告是一次三通道的信息广播</h2><p>一个招式在打出前，Boss 要通过多条感官通道向玩家「广播」它的意图。三条主通道各有分工：<strong>动画</strong>（姿态、蓄力方向、武器轨迹）负责传达「是什么招、往哪打」；<strong>VFX</strong>（光效、地面标记、颜色）负责强调「危险区域和强度」；<strong>音频</strong>（吼叫、蓄力音、专属音效）负责在玩家视线之外（背后、镜头外）也能预警。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[Boss 决定出招] --&gt; B[广播意图]&#10;  B --&gt; C[动画通道&lt;br/&gt;姿态/蓄力/武器轨迹]&#10;  B --&gt; D[VFX 通道&lt;br/&gt;光效/地标/危险区]&#10;  B --&gt; E[音频通道&lt;br/&gt;吼叫/蓄力音]&#10;  C --&gt; F[玩家识别]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{反应窗口 t_tel - t_react}&#10;  G --&gt;|充足| H[正确应对&lt;br/&gt;公平]&#10;  G --&gt;|不足| I[被迫猜/挨打&lt;br/&gt;不公平]\">flowchart TD\n  A[Boss 决定出招] --&gt; B[广播意图]\n  B --&gt; C[动画通道&lt;br/&gt;姿态/蓄力/武器轨迹]\n  B --&gt; D[VFX 通道&lt;br/&gt;光效/地标/危险区]\n  B --&gt; E[音频通道&lt;br/&gt;吼叫/蓄力音]\n  C --&gt; F[玩家识别]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{反应窗口 t_tel - t_react}\n  G --&gt;|充足| H[正确应对&lt;br/&gt;公平]\n  G --&gt;|不足| I[被迫猜/挨打&lt;br/&gt;不公平]</pre><p>三通道冗余是关键：不能只靠动画，因为镜头外或视觉混乱时玩家看不见；也不能只靠音效，因为它不传达空间信息。冗余广播让预告在各种情境下都能穿透。这条原则直接服务于 <a href=\"../foundations/encounter-model\">遭遇战模型</a> 强调的「信息对称」——玩家有权获得足够信息来做正确决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反应窗口的数学下限\">反应窗口的数学下限</h2><p>预告段时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{tel}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须给玩家留出足够的反应窗口。人类的视觉简单反应时间约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>250</mn><mtext> ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200\\text{–}250\\text{ ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">250</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>，复杂选择反应（要判断是哪种招再选应对）还要更长。玩家真正可用的窗口是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{window} = t_{tel} - t_{react} - t_{input}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{react}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是识别 + 决策时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{input}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是从按下按键到角色动作生效的延迟（含输入缓冲和动画启动）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{window} &lt; t_{dodge}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（闪避所需时间）时，这一招在纯反应下就不可躲，玩家只能靠预判。这解释了一个业界长期争议：输入缓冲问题从《恶魔之魂》延续到《只狼》《艾尔登法环》这类高速游戏，当分秒必争时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{input}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的隐性延迟会实实在在地吃掉玩家的反应窗口。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>招式类型</th>\n<th>建议 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{tel}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>可躲依据</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>常规攻击</td>\n<td>300–500ms</td>\n<td>纯反应</td>\n<td>教学期尤其要宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快速突进</td>\n<td>400–600ms</td>\n<td>反应 + 预判</td>\n<td>靠音效补前摇</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大范围 AOE</td>\n<td>800–1500ms</td>\n<td>反应 + 走位</td>\n<td>地面预警标记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抓取/秒杀</td>\n<td>≥600ms 且独特音效</td>\n<td>反应</td>\n<td>惩罚重，须最易读</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"延迟攻击-合法的心理博弈\">延迟攻击：合法的心理博弈</h2><p>近年硬核 Boss 大量使用<strong>延迟攻击</strong>——抬手后故意停顿零点几秒再挥下，专门惩罚玩家的「条件反射式提前闪避」。这是合法且高级的设计：它把纯反应考验升级为「读节奏」考验，玩家必须看着招式实际落下的时机而非抬手瞬间来闪避。</p>\n<p>但延迟攻击是双刃剑。用得好，它给战斗增加深度和「一招要练三次才躲得过」的记忆点；用得滥，玩家会抱怨节奏「飘忽不定、无法预测」，就像社区对某些法环 Boss 的批评——攻击缺少可靠的间隙、节奏不一致让人难以建立肌肉记忆。关键区别在于：延迟的时长应当是<strong>有限的几个固定档位</strong>（可学习），而非连续随机（不可学习）。前者是「难」，后者是「不公平」。这条界线与 <a href=\"attack-patterns\">招式与模式</a> 里混合招「须留可区分线索」是同一条原则的两面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可读性的工程约束-混乱-色彩与无障碍\">可读性的工程约束：混乱、色彩与无障碍</h2><p>预告在理论上清晰，在实战画面里未必读得出。三个常见的工程约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>视觉混乱</strong>：多个特效、小兵、场地光效叠加时，Boss 的预告可能被淹没。解法是给关键预告更高的视觉优先级（更亮、更大、独占某种颜色语言），必要时压暗其他元素。</li>\n<li><strong>色彩依赖</strong>：若危险区只靠红色标记，色盲玩家将失去关键信息。稳健做法是「颜色 + 形状 + 动画」多重编码，这属于无障碍设计的通用原则，详见 <a href=\"../../game-accessibility/\">无障碍游戏设计</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>相机遮挡</strong>：贴身时相机可能被 Boss 巨大的身躯挡住预告动画，这时音频通道成为唯一防线，相机本身的处理见 <a href=\"../../game-camera-systems/dynamic-systems/look-at-targeting\">相机系统·锁定与朝向</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些约束意味着预告设计不是策划一个人的事，而是策划、动画、VFX、音频、UI 的协作产物——如何组织这条协作链，是 <a href=\"../practice/boss-design-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>预告是三通道冗余广播：动画传达「是什么招/往哪打」、VFX 强调危险区、音频覆盖视线外；冗余让预告在任何情境穿透。</li>\n<li>可用反应窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{window}=t_{tel}-t_{react}-t_{input}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；输入缓冲的隐性延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{input}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 会实实在在吃掉窗口，是高速游戏的长期争议点。</li>\n<li>延迟攻击是合法的「读节奏」考验，但延迟必须是有限固定档位（可学习）而非连续随机（不可学习）——这是「难」与「不公平」的分界。</li>\n<li>工程上要处理视觉混乱（给关键预告更高优先级）、色彩依赖（颜色+形状+动画多重编码）、相机遮挡（音频兜底）。</li>\n<li>预告是策划/动画/VFX/音频/UI 的协作产物，不是单人工作。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"attack-patterns\">招式与模式</a> —— 混合招的可区分线索与预告是同一原则。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../practice/boss-design-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> —— 预告背后的多工种协作链如何组织。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../combat-system-design/balance-feel/combat-feel-feedback\">战斗系统设计·战斗手感与反馈</a> —— 命中反馈与预告共同构成战斗的可读性。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-accessibility/\">无障碍游戏设计</a> —— 色盲友好与多重编码的通用无障碍原则。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"预告与可读性：公平感的全部秘密","id":"预告与可读性-公平感的全部秘密"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：预告是一次三通道的信息广播","id":"核心概念-预告是一次三通道的信息广播"},{"level":2,"text":"反应窗口的数学下限","id":"反应窗口的数学下限"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟攻击：合法的心理博弈","id":"延迟攻击-合法的心理博弈"},{"level":2,"text":"可读性的工程约束：混乱、色彩与无障碍","id":"可读性的工程约束-混乱-色彩与无障碍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"招式与模式：从单招到攻防博弈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-boss-encounter-design/structure/attack-patterns"},"next":{"title":"难度曲线：一场战斗内部的起承转合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-boss-encounter-design/pacing/difficulty-curve"}}